## Provenance and scope

This database is an AGGREGATION of publicly available football information from
multiple sources. It is published as FACTS (results, dates, appearances, career
records) rather than verbatim reproductions of any source's text. Individual
facts carry source attribution in the data itself.

The ODbL applies to the database and its structure — the compilation this
project creates. It does not assert ownership over the underlying public facts.

